Package: com.evgeniy558.controlcenter18
Name: ControlCenter18 (iOS 15)
Version: 3.0-beta-ios15.20
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: ControlCenter18 3.0-beta ported to iOS 15.8.8 (arm64, rootless).
 The original tweak is built for iOS 16/17 and links the iOS 16 Objective-C ABI.
 This package adds a compatibility dylib for objc_release_xN,
 objc_retain_xN and objc_claimAutoreleasedReturnValue, and provides the
 MobileSubstrate hook API through ElleKit (or a runtime fallback) so the tweak
 can load on iOS 15 without CydiaSubstrate.
 .
 Tested target: iPhone 6s/7/8, iOS 15.8.8, Dopamine/ElleKit rootless.
 Enable it in Settings > ControlCenter18, then respring.
Maintainer: Ray
Author: evgeniy558 (original), Ray (iOS 15 port)
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate | ellekit, firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<< 18.0), preferenceloader
